    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Snap, Scrap, Explore!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cozy adventure-platformer featuring several small but dense &quot;open-world&quot; islands. Jet around, photographing oddities, befriending eccentric locals, and personalising your scrapbook. Use your camera to uncover hidden secrets, and place objects in your scrapbook to influence the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Find Your Way Through a Whimsical Island Adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover three vibrant islands full of eccentric characters, hidden secrets, and unexpected oddities. Jet-pack, jump, and wander through cozy landscapes at your own pace \u2014 no timer, no pressure, just curiosity and charm around every corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chat with islanders, help them with their problems, and receive delightful gifts to add to your collection. Off the beaten path, you'll find secret areas, mysterious puzzles, and surprises tucked away for the most curious explorers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848640/extras/cc15a7c68cc0eee816d8b6af213326d5.poster.avif?t=1754585616\" width=328 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848640/extras/cc15a7c68cc0eee816d8b6af213326d5.webm?t=1754585616\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848640/extras/cc15a7c68cc0eee816d8b6af213326d5.mp4?t=1754585616\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Snap &amp; Collect</strong>: Use your camera to document local wildlife  in your photo compendium - and earn a reward if you can collect \u2018em all!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Personalized Scrapbooking</strong>: Stick your favourite photos and items into your scrapbook, creating a personal log of your adventure and influencing the world around you.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quirky Interactions</strong>: Befriend the locals, learn their stories, and unlock unique rewards.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A World Made to Wander</strong>: No combat, no rush \u2014 just a relaxing journey full of gentle discovery and a water-based jet pack to navigate it with.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
